#: ../../plugins.rst:159
msgid "5. Read the implementation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../plugins.rst:162
msgid "The complete package below is the source compiled in step 2. Download :download:`badge.odin <_static/repository/build-plugin.odin>` and :download:`main.odin <_static/repository/build-plugin-main.odin>` to keep a local copy. Keep their directory structure, or adjust the relative imports in your own project."
